    "%lld Selected" : {

    },
    "⌘N is each area’s primary action — Run Container, Build or Pull an image, Create, or Log In. In Containers, ⇧⌘N launches a Compose stack. ⌘F filters the current list, ⌘, opens Settings, and ⌘? opens this Help. The empty screens also list the shortcuts that apply there." : {

